          "type": "text",
          "text": "The vertical axis of a bar chart is cut off at 125. The first bar reaches 170 and the second reaches 197. The difference between their displayed heights is what percentage of the first bar's displayed height?"
        }
      ],
      "marks": 3,
      "primary_outcome": "1.7",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
        "type": "numeric",
        "comparison_mode": "exact_numeric",
